    "MissionGiver": "Covalex Independent Contractors",
    "Title": "Orison Relief: Medium Supply Haul",
    "TitleKey": "ORS_MedicalAid_HaulingMedium_Title",
    "Description": "Hey, it\u2019s El.\n\nCrusader is still trying to make things right in Orison following the attack, so I\u2019m hoping you\u2019re free to keep assisting with the effort.\n\nWe been contracted to deliver relief supplies to <EM4>~mission(Destination|Target|Address)</EM4>. Pick up\u2019s at <EM4>~mission(Location|Target|Address)</EM4>. \nNot too shabby a haul either, so make sure you\u2019re in a ship that can hold <EM4>~mission(MissionMaxSCUSize) cargo containers</EM4> and bring a <EM4>handheld tractor beam</EM4>, or you\u2019ll make us all look unprofessional.\n\nI\u2019m not kidding around with this job being important to get done right. Lotta people got hurt during the Nine Tails raid, and they\u2019re relying on people like us to get them the help they need. So let\u2019s do right by them, okay?\n\nElla Tieno \nJr. Logistics Coordinator \nCovalex Shipping   \n'Anything you need, anywhere you need it.'",
    "DescriptionKey": "ORS_MedicalAid_HaulingMedium_desc",
    "DisplayDescription": "Hey, it\u2019s El.\n\nCrusader is still trying to make things right in Orison following the attack, so I\u2019m hoping you\u2019re free to keep assisting with the effort.\n\nWe been contracted to deliver relief supplies to <EM4>Orison</EM4>. Pick up\u2019s at <EM4>[Location|Target|Address]</EM4>. \nNot too shabby a haul either, so make sure you\u2019re in a ship that can hold <EM4>24 SCU cargo containers</EM4> and bring a <EM4>handheld tractor beam</EM4>, or you\u2019ll make us all look unprofessional.\n\nI\u2019m not kidding around with this job being important to get done right. Lotta people got hurt during the Nine Tails raid, and they\u2019re relying on people like us to get them the help they need. So let\u2019s do right by them, okay?\n\nElla Tieno \nJr. Logistics Coordinator \nCovalex Shipping   \n'Anything you need, anywhere you need it.'",
